                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b8c9eea-aa07-467a-964b-442170d7f60a",
                        "source_entry_id": "6982f51f-839b-358f-a7bf-d2ca0d822472",
                        "source_sense_id": "69d076f2-9b55-35ab-9cb3-e3cd465c77cc",
                        "target_lang_word": "simp",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simp",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94d4d91f-5992-311e-b255-31d7b7283cfa",
                                        "entry_id": "a7a432cb-ab74-3b3d-8830-1bc07e3b84d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A man who foolishly overvalues and defers to a woman, putting her on a pedestal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6adf403-9b7f-480a-b43e-14c39cf9b376",
                                                "sense_id": "94d4d91f-5992-311e-b255-31d7b7283cfa",
                                                "text": "Baby got it goin' on / A lot of simps won't like this song / 'Cause them punks like to hit it and quit it / And I'd rather stay and play"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f847c20-ea11-4db8-817b-8e46b97a3f7c",
                                                "sense_id": "94d4d91f-5992-311e-b255-31d7b7283cfa",
                                                "text": "Until you are sure that this girl has a genuine interest and might be compatible, no dates or gifts. Why should you be the one who feeds every straggler in your town? It's time to break away from these byzantine patterns of square behavior. It's time right now to break away from all those years of bad programming. You're a simp because your family made you that way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08f8353a-8bf4-4481-8120-e54490ba1796",
                                                "sense_id": "94d4d91f-5992-311e-b255-31d7b7283cfa",
                                                "text": "I don't be like some of those halfass simps. I'm a player, you understand?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d009cfdc-bf66-4b46-b379-5aeac75c82d1",
                                                "sense_id": "94d4d91f-5992-311e-b255-31d7b7283cfa",
                                                "text": "And then something happened that seems kinda strange. He bought her a house. Just a few blocks away. His girlfriend won't touch him. She calls him a wimp. I'm sorry to tell you your daddy's a simp."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de3c1b33-a541-35cd-9b4a-8bfdbe43bc1c",
                                        "entry_id": "a7a432cb-ab74-3b3d-8830-1bc07e3b84d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who foolishly overvalues someone else and defers to them, putting them on a pedestal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "127be695-54ce-4bed-ab39-6b9bc42ad994",
                                                "sense_id": "de3c1b33-a541-35cd-9b4a-8bfdbe43bc1c",
                                                "text": "“Trump simp”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7cf5ece-b0df-45bd-ab06-28e234577d0d",
                                                "sense_id": "de3c1b33-a541-35cd-9b4a-8bfdbe43bc1c",
                                                "text": "Tweet: Crosbee @crosbeelisser . Oct 25 I'm a simp for @justnfields."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42fa5001-f52a-4f01-90f3-c9c779f9664e",
                                                "sense_id": "de3c1b33-a541-35cd-9b4a-8bfdbe43bc1c",
                                                "text": "\"If I can put it in really plain English, Mr Morrison needs to make sure he doesn't look like he's just a simp to Donald Trump,\" Shorten said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3bf0a157-c8f4-3c7d-9bbc-a805724b2eff",
                                        "entry_id": "a7a432cb-ab74-3b3d-8830-1bc07e3b84d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate for an ideology or cause."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "simp",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e6206f1-5707-3a48-b3de-ded8e58b6e26",
                                        "entry_id": "d3991971-0fc6-3dde-ba11-75af753481f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A simple person lacking common sense; a fool or simpleton."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75a11a4f-b9ea-478e-bfcd-2f584b1d7b54",
                                                "sense_id": "6e6206f1-5707-3a48-b3de-ded8e58b6e26",
                                                "text": "Pimps and simps would fall in from here and there and everywhere, grabbing thousand-dollar advances from the madames and leaving their lady friends in pawn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "169caa5c-9124-40a7-909c-ec4b2a7844cb",
                                                "sense_id": "6e6206f1-5707-3a48-b3de-ded8e58b6e26",
                                                "text": "Groggy from my nap I turn on the TV and try to watch.... Morons and simps appear in the screen, drool like pinheads and waterheads...."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ffd5770-c6b9-4140-8337-37544df94830",
                                                "sense_id": "6e6206f1-5707-3a48-b3de-ded8e58b6e26",
                                                "text": "By a cruel irony, however, the elitist power serves the secret ends of the masses whom they despise. The real snobs are the people. The real simps are the intellectuals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8dcf67b0-708b-4997-8775-81f782a9399e",
                                                "sense_id": "6e6206f1-5707-3a48-b3de-ded8e58b6e26",
                                                "text": "This list has been limited to members and cohorts of the Clinton administration, those simps and ninnies, lava-lamp liberals and condo pinks, spoiled twerps, wiffenpoofs, ratchet-jawed purveyors of monkey doodle and baked wind, piddlers upon merit, beggars at the door of accomplishment, thieves of livelihood, envy-coddling tax lice applauding themselves for their magnanimity with the money of others, their nose in virtue's bum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7affa886-cd58-4c32-95bc-31fc2225e22f",
                                                "sense_id": "6e6206f1-5707-3a48-b3de-ded8e58b6e26",
                                                "text": "“What a simp I am. I can't believe I left it at home.” She leans her forehead against her locker, straightens, and then turns to me. “Can you believe what a simp I am?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33132547-e263-39e6-9722-61e10c6f1405",
                                        "entry_id": "d3991971-0fc6-3dde-ba11-75af753481f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who is not worthy of respect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9f81150-4052-4ef2-98c8-1084dd5873d7",
                                                "sense_id": "33132547-e263-39e6-9722-61e10c6f1405",
                                                "text": "The JEWS own this country, the IRISH run it, the BRITISH envy it, the GERMANS cuss it, the NEGROES enjoy it, the FRENCH style and perfume it, the CHINESE wash it, BOOTLEGGERS irrigate it, the GREEKS feed and shine it, the JAPS fear it, MEXICANS hate it, RUSSIANS pity it, the ITALIANS fruit it, ALL NATIONS cigarette it, EVERYBODY likes it, and the AMERICANS—well, those poor simps just pay the bills and can keep out of jail if they behave themselves and are very careful about their driving and parking."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fdb67c3-e575-48e6-9084-910e537c519c",
                                                "sense_id": "33132547-e263-39e6-9722-61e10c6f1405",
                                                "text": "All of this, inspired by hypersensitive simps who never once had to demonstrate that, by reasonable standards, they had been victimized in any way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de5b09cb-4ab7-4d57-96ee-a18bb09ca2dd",
                                                "sense_id": "33132547-e263-39e6-9722-61e10c6f1405",
                                                "text": "A real pimp is a gentleman, but these are pimps in gorilla suits. They hang around pimps, they have hoes on the track working for them, they may even look like pimps, but they are straight simps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c33b31e-c653-42a9-86d0-0c372988c701",
                                                "sense_id": "33132547-e263-39e6-9722-61e10c6f1405",
                                                "text": "Of course,a guy who wanted to run for office would have to get himself snipped BEFORE he had children, but that's not a big deal since most of the officious little simps who go on to be your mayor realize very early on that they're not going to work for a living."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "simp",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28dcada0-74d7-3d14-91cf-d806eb532474",
                                        "entry_id": "5d0a9fdb-d21b-349e-b78e-7cede76cc24a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be especially deferential to and emotionally vulnerable with a woman, often with the intent of receiving sexual gratification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33c661ba-a639-46cf-ac65-c86806b6d955",
                                                "sense_id": "28dcada0-74d7-3d14-91cf-d806eb532474",
                                                "text": "1992, Fatlip (The Pharcyde), Passin’ Me By lyrics\nNow let me tell you 'bout the feelings I feel for you / When I try or make some sort of attempt, I simp / Damn, I wish I wasn't such a wimp"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d1713a6-03a7-465f-ad48-2b28b2e651c4",
                                                "sense_id": "28dcada0-74d7-3d14-91cf-d806eb532474",
                                                "text": "2013, TravieBASED, Whats Wrong With Simping?\nDudes wanna talk down on other dudes when they start simping like they're feminine or something when in fact the majority of all dudes and even those motherfuckers saying that shit be simping too."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce2bf104-ff37-48b3-8a0e-770e103925e2",
                                                "sense_id": "28dcada0-74d7-3d14-91cf-d806eb532474",
                                                "text": "2018, T.y (@Ty_Brazil), Tweet.\nG why is simping becoming so popular ? It’s nothing wrong with treating your lady nice , but some of these niggas out straight simping"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45f2f998-25f9-42eb-b2e0-a1d1cf39c81a",
                                                "sense_id": "28dcada0-74d7-3d14-91cf-d806eb532474",
                                                "text": "2018, Penny the Petty Pest (@PineappleGC), Tweet.\nYall be simping in bitches DMs, then trying them on the tl then getting shocked why u getting aired out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20a33281-adc9-375e-b24b-680839c95174",
                                        "entry_id": "5d0a9fdb-d21b-349e-b78e-7cede76cc24a",
